<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian soldiers were shot by unidentified gunmen in eastern Deir ez-Zor, killing one and wounding two, with similar attacks reported in Jadidat Bakara. Female teachers on the Syrian coast face transfers and job loss as thousands of resignations threaten schools, while SDF employees demand job security and leadership changes. An all-female Kurdish force is joining the Interior Ministry, and Damascus is engaged in fighting with Hezbollah. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOMDRzLVFKYU5SQjBqZDMyZm5hT3FGeDJybE5OZWVPeGNOZ2ZGZ25JazBJVWc1Y1VKYlY5Rm03UGhlU1hqR0p1V3Nmd1BucE5kcHJLS0RYQ0dyN1NXaklGSlNlczNoa3otNDB0Mzg3U1NaeHpVQWd4S0YyVElzODhCMjQzUlU0SHJWaFZlXzlJenVFTTRqNHkzdHd5ckdTRnYxbHR3dklzbzUwY012emdXREh2OEo0SzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNTkxBeVhnX1VDRGN0SENHY25rcWxIQTd6T3NINkdLUGxISkxpY3hrMnZiRTdRbmZZSE4zZ2RlcUppM1RvTXJWa19La1dGblFKZ2dvekNsdnBheUdBclFaMExfOTk0cXBIMHZPNWk4WnRNSDJyLTBDc3ZDejA4ZFhXSFBlT1hCcExKQUlsM0xvZzVQWUVGNkxmTmI0UUM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Tribunal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;JINHAGENCY&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi